{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "b28c39e2bc894e4e98ee728bcf7d2083",
    "m_Title": "HOW THIS OUTLINE WORKS",
    "m_Content": "A second mesh grows out from its center. Only its back faces are drawn, so the original mesh hides the middle and leaves a blue edge. World-space width keeps a thin sticky note visible. Change Sky Blue Color or Outline Width in the material. The player script supplies Mesh Center for each renderer.",
